{title: He Lifted Me}
{artist: Charles Gabriel}
{key: Bb}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 88}

Verse 1
In [Bb]loving-kindness [Eb]Jesus [Bb]came, my soul in mercy [F]to reclaim,
and [Bb]from the depths of [Eb]sin and [Bb]shame through [F]grace he [Bb]lifted me.

Chorus
From [Bb]sinking sand [Eb]he lifted [Bb]me; with tender hand [C]he lifted [F]me;
from [Bb]shades of night to [Eb]planes of [Bb]light — O [F]praise his name, he [Bb]lifted me!
